--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -66,6 +66,10 @@ Allow people to move between OSS and SAAS Fizzy instances:
 - Exports/Imports can be written to/read from local or S3 storage depending on the config of the instance (both must be supported)
 - Must be able to handle very large ZIP files (500+GB)
 - Models in `app/models/account/data_transfer/`, `app/models/zip_file`
+- Account exports (`Account::Export`) hold one JSON file per record, plus every stored file; personal exports (`User::DataExport`) hold the cards someone can see, in a human-readable form
+- Imports (`Account::Import`) check every record before writing anything, insert in batches, and resume from a cursor when interrupted. A failed import removes everything it created
+- Record IDs are kept when they don't exist in the instance yet, and remapped otherwise (`Account::DataTransfer::IdMapping`)
+- When adding a model with account data, add it to `Account::DataTransfer::Manifest`, or exports will leave it out
 
 ## Coding style
 
